{"t":"Critical Hit","s":"critical-hit-bebeb","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Critical_Hit_Effect_d959c3.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox2 pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Critical Hit</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.94<br/>May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Critical Hit Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Critical_Hit_Effect_d959c3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> <b>Critical Hits</b>, introduced with Summer Update 2016, is a way to deal more damage than usual. Critical Hits have a certain chance to be triggered and a certain amount of extra damage. The chance to trigger a Critical Hit can be increased by the Low Blow Charm and by Strike Imbuements. Since the Summer Update 2025, every character has intrinsic 5% chance to deal 10% extra critical damage. \n<p>Some specific creatures are capable of doing critical hits against players.\n</p><p>The known sources that influence Critical Hits are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>weapons imbued with Basic, Intricate or <a href=\"#/wiki/Powerful%20Strike\">Powerful Strike</a></li>\n<li>equipment with additional Critical Hit Chance attributes</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheel%20of%20Destiny\">Wheel of Destiny</a> Augments for characters, or equipment that grants critical related augments</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapons\">Weapons</span></h2>\n<p>The following weapons have additional Critical Hit chance or damage:\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Rods_and_Wands\">Rods and Wands</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Lvl\n</th>\n<th>Dmg\n</th>\n<th><small>Dmg Type</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Range</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Mana per Shot</small>\n</th>\n<th>Resist.\n</th>\n<th><small>Imb. Slots</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Class.</small>\n</th>\n<th><small>Weight</small>\n</th>\n<th>Attributes\n</th>\n<th>Dropped By\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Rod\">Lion Rod</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Rod\"><img alt=\"Lion Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Rod_3bac44.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>270\n</td>\n<td>85-105\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Ice Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_68a15e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>26.00\n</td>\n<td>critical hit chance +5%, critical extra damage +25%, magic level +2\n</td>\n<td><small><div class=\"div-creature-list-generic creature-table\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Lion%20Knight\">Ancient Lion Knight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cobra Wand\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Cobra Wand\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cobra_Wand_0b55de.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td>270\n</td>\n<t